OL,3,A'We're a capitalist society': Grindr
OL,4,Adefends $120 a month premium tier
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe world's largest LGBTQ+ dating app,
OL,7,FGrindr, has defended its $120 (#91) per
OL,8,Fmonth premium subscription service,
OL,9,Fwhich launches globally today.
OL,11,FEdge offers AI-powered services such as
OL,12,Fdaily personalised profile
OL,13,Frecommendations that aim to provide
OL,14,Fbetter matches and limit scrolling.
OL,16,FThe company's CEO, George Arison, told
OL,17,FBBC News it would be a "very different
OL,18,FGrindr experience" which was aimed at a
OL,19,F"small community of users" - and was
OL,20,Funapologetic about its cost.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
